@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1

### Crear torneo
# @name createTournament
POST {{baseUrl}}/tournaments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Copa Nacional",
  "date": "2026-11-15",
  "location": "San Salvador"
}

### Listar torneos (ordenados por fecha, mas reciente primero)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tournaments

### Obtener torneo por id
GET {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/{{createTournament.response.body.$.id}}

### Torneo inexistente -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/999999

### Actualizar estado del torneo (PATCH parcial)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/{{createTournament.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "in_progress"
}
